    {q:"Why can stepping away be a useful conflict response?", a:"It can reduce anger or help a person leave immediate danger, though a continuing problem may still need adult attention."},
    {q:"What should a mediator check before starting?", a:"Safety, voluntary participation, impartiality and whether the problem is appropriate for mediation."},
    {q:"Why must safety not be compromised?", a:"A person must not accept harm or threats as the price of an agreement; protection takes priority."}
